Notes
-----
* Short verbatim quotations from hospital financial-assistance policies are
  included as evidence for each field. The underlying policy documents remain
  the property of the hospitals that published them; we link to and hash them
  rather than re-host them in bulk.
* Federal source data (IRS Form 990 e-file XML, CMS Provider Data Catalog,
  HHS poverty guidelines) is public-domain U.S. government data.
* The synthetic demo corpus under data/demo/ describes fictional hospitals.
  Any resemblance to a real institution is coincidental.
* Nothing in the data is legal advice. "Likely eligible" is an estimate; the
  hospital makes the final decision.

